  "content": "<h3><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>此整合包需要核心模組「<a style=\"color:#fff\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/superb-warfare\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SuperB Warfare</a>」才能運行！</strong></span></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">此整合包目前處於深度開發階段</span></strong></span><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong><br></strong></span></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><span style=\"color:#fff\">此 SuperB Warfare 擴充包新增了軍用車輛。在未來的更新中，我們計劃加入：</span></h2><h3><span style=\"color:#fff\">1. 無人機</span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">2. 坦克</span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">3. 直升機</span><br><span style=\"color:#fff\">4. 其他軍用車輛</span></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>我們也建議下載 SBW 的原版風格材質包</strong> - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mcsp-military-vehicle\" rel=\"nofollow\">[SBW] MCSP - ADDON - Minecraft Mods - CurseForge</a></span></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><h1><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">禁止轉載至其他網站</span></span></strong></span></h1><p>&nbsp;</p><p>素材由 Gralva Studio、QMP、Roif 及 VVP 團隊製作，保留所有權利。</p><p><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><br><br><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">請將錯誤回報至 Discord - <a href=\"https://discord.gg/25XqCnUb4X\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord VVP</a></span></span></span></strong></span></p>",
